{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassEndomorphism.ChiPerIrrepCyclotomicClosedForms","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassEndomorphism.ChiPerIrrepCyclotomicClosedForms","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":15,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_diff_via_cyclotomic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_diff_via_cyclotomic","kind":"theorem","line":145,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-per-irrep-cyclotomic-closed-forms.lean#L145-L149","doc":"V_(1,1,1) closed form re-expressed via the cyclotomic factor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V21_diff_via_cyclotomic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V21_diff_via_cyclotomic","kind":"theorem","line":138,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-per-irrep-cyclotomic-closed-forms.lean#L138-L142","doc":"V_(2,1) closed form re-expressed via the cyclotomic factor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_diff_via_cyclotomic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_diff_via_cyclotomic","kind":"theorem","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-per-irrep-cyclotomic-closed-forms.lean#L131-L135","doc":"V_(3) closed form re-expressed via the cyclotomic factor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.cyclotomic_8_factor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.cyclotomic_8_factor","kind":"def","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-per-irrep-cyclotomic-closed-forms.lean#L125-L128","doc":"The numerator polynomial `(q⁴ + 1) (q² − 1)` for V_(2,1).\nFactors as `Φ_8(q) · Φ_2(q) · Φ_1(q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.cyclotomic_4_factor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.cyclotomic_4_factor","kind":"def","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-per-irrep-cyclotomic-closed-forms.lean#L120-L123","doc":"The numerator polynomial `(q² + 1)² (q² − 1)` shared by V_(3)\nand V_(1,1,1). Factors as `Φ_4(q)² · Φ_2(q) · Φ_1(q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_diff_at_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_diff_at_one","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-per-irrep-cyclotomic-closed-forms.lean#L115-L116","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V21_diff_at_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V21_diff_at_one","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-per-irrep-cyclotomic-closed-forms.lean#L112-L113","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_diff_at_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_diff_at_one","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-per-irrep-cyclotomic-closed-forms.lean#L107-L110","doc":"At q = 1: all three differences vanish (proton/neutron\nindistinguishable at the classical limit). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_eq_V3_div_q4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_eq_V3_div_q4","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-per-irrep-cyclotomic-closed-forms.lean#L91-L98","doc":"The closed forms for V_(3) and V_(1,1,1) share the same numerator\npolynomial `-(q² + 1)²(q² − 1)`; they differ only by the\ndenominator power (q vs q⁵). Equivalently:\n`chi_V111_diff_closed q = chi_V3_diff_closed q / q^4`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_diff_polynomial_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_diff_polynomial_form","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-per-irrep-cyclotomic-closed-forms.lean#L80-L86","doc":"V_(1,1,1) factored ↔ polynomial:\n`(-q^6 - q^4 + q^2 + 1) / (4 q^5)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V21_diff_polynomial_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V21_diff_polynomial_form","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-per-irrep-cyclotomic-closed-forms.lean#L72-L77","doc":"V_(2,1) factored ↔ polynomial: `(-q^6 + q^4 - q^2 + 1)/(4q^3)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_diff_polynomial_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_diff_polynomial_form","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-per-irrep-cyclotomic-closed-forms.lean#L64-L69","doc":"V_(3) factored ↔ polynomial: `-(q^6 + q^4 - q^2 - 1)/(4q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_diff_closed","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_diff_closed","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-per-irrep-cyclotomic-closed-forms.lean#L54-L59","doc":"**V_(1,1,1) closed form** (factored): `−(q²+1)²(q²−1) / (4q⁵)`.\nThe numerator equals V_(3)'s; only the denominator power differs.\nReason: V_(1,1,1) is the conjugate partition of V_(3), related\nby σ_i ↔ -σ_i⁻¹ (q ↔ -q⁻¹) substitution. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V21_diff_closed","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V21_diff_closed","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-per-irrep-cyclotomic-closed-forms.lean#L47-L52","doc":"**V_(2,1) closed form** (factored): `−(q⁴+1)(q²−1) / (4q³)`.\nDerived via Hoefsmit 2×2 matrix expansion + Markov trace; result\nmatches the symbolic `q_character_on_braid_word` evaluation in\n`probe_per_wedderburn_block_ck.py`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_diff_closed","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_diff_closed","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-per-irrep-cyclotomic-closed-forms.lean#L43-L45","doc":"**V_(3) closed form** (factored): `−(q²+1)²(q²−1) / (4q)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}